  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "2301701",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Garcia",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230170101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230170101": {
            "id": "230170101",
            "speakerId": 20657,
            "speakerName": "Garcia",
            "text": "T—Traveler! You're just in time. I was just about to go back to work after this coffee break with Ms. Kaia. Allow me to introduce you...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230170102"
            ]
          },
          "230170102": {
            "id": "230170102",
            "speakerId": 12700,
            "speakerName": "Kaia",
            "text": "Ah, so you must be the Traveler Garcia's been talking about. It's a pleasure to meet you, I'm Kaia, a... um... well, I dance.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230170104"
            ]
          },
          "230170104": {
            "id": "230170104",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Hello, Garcia mentioned you before, I believe.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230170105"
            ]
          },
          "230170105": {
            "id": "230170105",
            "speakerId": 12700,
            "speakerName": "Kaia",
            "text": "Hehe, is that so? I'm happy to hear that. I was beginning to think that he commits nothing but his machine and Lutong to memory.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230170106"
            ]
          },
          "230170106": {
            "id": "230170106",
            "speakerId": 20658,
            "speakerName": "Lutong",
            "text": "You can safely exclude me from this, Ma'am. I believe that this shall be to Mr. Garcia's liking, too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230170107"
            ]
          },
          "230170107": {
            "id": "230170107",
            "speakerId": 12700,
            "speakerName": "Kaia",
            "text": "Now, that wouldn't do. Without you, Garcia would surely find himself penniless in the end.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230170108"
            ]
          },
          "230170108": {
            "id": "230170108",
            "speakerId": 20658,
            "speakerName": "Lutong",
            "text": "Forgive me, Ma'am, if I must disagree. I am certain that Mr. Garcia would save up for two cups of coffee, no matter what.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230170109"
            ]
          },
          "230170109": {
            "id": "230170109",
            "speakerId": 20657,
            "speakerName": "Garcia",
            "text": "Make that three cups!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230170110"
            ]
          },
          "230170110": {
            "id": "230170110",
            "speakerId": 20658,
            "speakerName": "Lutong",
            "text": "You display most astonishing empathy, Mr. Garcia.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230170111"
            ]
          },
          "230170111": {
            "id": "230170111",
            "speakerId": 20657,
            "speakerName": "Garcia",
            "text": "Well, b—back to business! Now, Traveler, I am still in need of the insignias that the Treasure Hoarders carry with them. Should you find any, do consider selling them to me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230170112"
            ]
          },
          "230170112": {
            "id": "230170112",
            "speakerId": 20657,
            "speakerName": "Garcia",
            "text": "I have... earned some Mora recently. So you need not fret about your payment."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2301702",
      "subQuestName": "Obtain Treasures Hoarders' insignias for Garcia",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230170201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230170201": {
            "id": "230170201",
            "speakerId": 20657,
            "speakerName": "Garcia",
            "text": "Did you get the insignias?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2301703",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Garcia",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230170301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230170301": {
            "id": "230170301",
            "speakerId": 20657,
            "speakerName": "Garcia",
            "text": "Hmm... These should suffice for my research.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230170302"
            ]
          },
          "230170302": {
            "id": "230170302",
            "speakerId": 20657,
            "speakerName": "Garcia",
            "text": "Here's your payment. Do accept it, if you would be so kind...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230170303"
            ]
          },
          "230170303": {
            "id": "230170303",
            "speakerId": 20657,
            "speakerName": "Garcia",
            "text": "Traveler, why are you giving me that look? You're making me nervous.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230170304"
            ]
          },
          "230170304": {
            "id": "230170304",
            "speakerId": 20657,
            "speakerName": "Garcia",
            "text": "Ahem! I am going back to work now. Yes, back to work..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2301704",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Garcia",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230170401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230170401": {
            "id": "230170401",
            "speakerId": 20657,
            "speakerName": "Garcia",
            "text": "Oh! These insignias look to be of high quality!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230170402"
            ]
          },
          "230170402": {
            "id": "230170402",
            "speakerId": 20657,
            "speakerName": "Garcia",
            "text": "Here's your payment. Do kindly accept this...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230170403"
            ]
          },
          "230170403": {
            "id": "230170403",
            "speakerId": 20657,
            "speakerName": "Garcia",
            "text": "Traveler, why are you giving me that look? You're making me nervous.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230170404"
            ]
          },
          "230170404": {
            "id": "230170404",
            "speakerId": 20657,
            "speakerName": "Garcia",
            "text": "Ahem! I am going back to work now. Yes, back to work..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2301750",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230175001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230175001": {
            "id": "230175001",
            "speakerId": 12700,
            "speakerName": "Kaia",
            "text": "Hello? Um... What would you like to know?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230175002"
            ]
          },
          "230175002": {
            "id": "230175002",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "How did you get to know Mr. Garcia?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230175003"
            ]
          },
          "230175003": {
            "id": "230175003",
            "speakerId": 12700,
            "speakerName": "Kaia",
            "text": "Cutting straight to the chase, huh? As befits an adventurer, I suppose.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230175004"
            ]
          },
          "230175004": {
            "id": "230175004",
            "speakerId": 12700,
            "speakerName": "Kaia",
            "text": "I got to meet Garcia because... our troupe director hired him as an accountant.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230175005"
            ]
          },
          "230175005": {
            "id": "230175005",
            "speakerId": 12700,
            "speakerName": "Kaia",
            "text": "Haha, to be honest, I have never seen anyone quite so incompatible with our troupe.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230175006"
            ]
          },
          "230175006": {
            "id": "230175006",
            "speakerId": 12700,
            "speakerName": "Kaia",
            "text": "We were playing music, dancing, drinking, and singing, and there he was on the sidelines, doing his calculations in silence with Lutong.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230175007"
            ]
          },
          "230175007": {
            "id": "230175007",
            "speakerId": 12700,
            "speakerName": "Kaia",
            "text": "There was a time when I saw him in strange clothes that had some drawings on it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230175008"
            ]
          },
          "230175008": {
            "id": "230175008",
            "speakerId": 12700,
            "speakerName": "Kaia",
            "text": "I was curious and asked about the drawing. He said that it was the blueprint of a machine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230175009"
            ]
          },
          "230175009": {
            "id": "230175009",
            "speakerId": 12700,
            "speakerName": "Kaia",
            "text": "He said he drew on his outfit because he happened to have neither pen nor paper when he was telling someone about the machine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230175010"
            ]
          },
          "230175010": {
            "id": "230175010",
            "speakerId": 12700,
            "speakerName": "Kaia",
            "text": "As such, he used coal to draw on his own outfit to demonstrate and explain the blueprint.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230175011"
            ]
          },
          "230175011": {
            "id": "230175011",
            "speakerId": 12700,
            "speakerName": "Kaia",
            "text": "Then we spent a lot of time talking about that outfit and his machine... And, of course, he did most of the talking, while I was the listener.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230175012"
            ]
          },
          "230175012": {
            "id": "230175012",
            "speakerId": 12700,
            "speakerName": "Kaia",
            "text": "Hehe, he really is a weirdo but... he is also quite the charmer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2301751",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230175101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230175101": {
            "id": "230175101",
            "speakerId": 14069,
            "speakerName": "Lutong",
            "text": "This should be a good thing, I suppose..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2301799",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230179901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230179901": {
            "id": "230179901",
            "speakerId": 14068,
            "speakerName": "Garcia",
            "text": "(Etiquette, etiquette! For goodness' sake, don't forget your etiquette!)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230179902"
            ]
          },
          "230179902": {
            "id": "230179902",
            "speakerId": 14069,
            "speakerName": "Lutong",
            "text": "(Should I tell Mr. Garcia that his features are contorted...?)"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}